OL,3,AEx-UK political aide Steve Hilton loses
OL,4,Abid for California governor to Democrat
OL,5,
OL,6,FSteve Hilton, the former senior adviser
OL,7,Fto British Prime Minister David
OL,8,FCameron, has lost his bid for
OL,9,FCalifornia governor to Democrat Xavier
OL,10,FBecerra.
OL,12,FHilton, who was endorsed by President
OL,13,FDonald Trump, faced an uphill battle as
OL,14,Fa Republican in the widely liberal
OL,15,Fstate. His loss was projected within
OL,16,Fminutes of polls closing in California.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
