OL,3,AEx-UK political aide Steve Hilton loses
OL,4,Abid for California governor to Democrat
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolls had suggested he had a slim
OL,7,Fchance at victory, especially on an
OL,8,Felection night where Democrats saw
OL,9,Fhistoric wins. He had campaigned to
OL,10,F"save" the state from what he described
OL,11,Fas overbearing bureaucracy and economic
OL,12,Fdecline.
OL,14,FBecerra will be the state's first
OL,15,FLatino governor in more than 150 years.
OL,16,FHe succeeds term-limited Gavin Newsom.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
